  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community is individuals who experience or are familiar with modern dating culture, particularly those who have encountered the phenomenon of being 'ghosted' or stood up after a date. The meme uses a universally relatable emotional expression (disappointment, resignation) to connect with anyone who has faced dating rejection, regardless of specific demographic characteristics. The visual of a young Black man is used as a neutral, relatable figure to represent the experience, not as a stereotype or caricature, and the overall intent is to humorously depict a common social experience without targeting any specific group based on race, gender, religion, or other protected characteristics.",
